---
description: Decide field-level findings for modelProduction.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Reconcile cast availability, venue constraints, props, accessibility arrangements, and participant boundaries. Identify scenes requiring qualified stage control or specific resources, and keep physical-safety instructions outside improvisational model authority. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
